AND A COVERAGE MISS WORTH KEEPING: the first test for the human-readable clause
grepped the SOURCE FILE, so it passed while the line it asserted about was
never executed. Replaced with a test that builds a finding, runs
verify_taint_claim, and reads the sentence back -- plus a negative control
where an identical flow at a class-M sink stays in the headline.

